      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## PowerScale - Cluster List\n\nMulti-cluster overview for Dell PowerScale clusters. Each cluster shows node count, health status, CPU utilisation, storage capacity, and NFS/SMB protocol statistics.\n\n* Use the **Cluster** dropdown to select one or more clusters.\n* Click a cluster name to navigate to the [Cluster Detail](/d/powerscale-cluster-detail/powerscale-cluster-detail) dashboard.\n* Click **WebUI** to open the cluster management interface.",
